9.png", "id": "1422471648869413", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828050_1422471652202746_3110232475221005870_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iXo2VKbglUUQ7kNvwE3Rh34&_nc_oc=AdrHAzuiR8EYGtnUh5zF9AMmb7G6k2A5bkNETP_rSpz2E59vx6_Y0XPR-UsURm-xIFQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5Ri4F5wV3hlb6pFfu1Do5OJvep4UhnvZQOg63oZSS3Jg&oe=6A1C299D"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1925251701697621", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1925251708364287_5148718230281366540_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yPA5Y9P4-jkQ7kNvwEevdEh&_nc_oc=AdruS6pSX6V76qzSMskFGF55Q3DZwCHTM5TDvgFNvEtnosOopKI0nTuAGSSjW4dIzxM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5wLEv8Y_lvdMoDgAdt5bB1tOZe1E4r4Ke1DveaZKDYfw&oe=6A1C3957"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Miniature youtube.png", "id": "948265401147327", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823270_948265404480660_2786606701152126884_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8_QoxCYnmF0Q7kNvwGDRrVs&_nc_oc=AdolI9s76CxZAO-vixoYA5_aQMUnIHQJVofkSrFprOQ9r5-2dKElR_ARuZGOFzdzXYw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5qSKp5LN_9SV1L1Fz6hYQxDgpvKs0dDFowzJkYJWKsYA&oe=6A1C29B8"}, "display_name": "Cr\u00eape Master!", "keywords": ["adventure", "combat", "craft", "magic", "magicalgirl"], "long_description": "**Cr\u00eape Master!** is a fun, solo beat them all adventure in a colorful magical-girl style. Become the reincarnation of the Cr\u00eape Goddess and defend Earth against an alien invasion that threatens the world\u2019s most beloved treat.\n\n# Features\n\n**YOUR WEAPON IS\u2026 A PAN!**\n{1464856455317006}\n\nSwing, and bonk with all your energy in a fast, frantic fight. Break their guards, knock them out, and recover the stolen ingredients to save the world.\n\n**MAGICAL GIRL POSE**\n{1433306058531539}\n\nEver dreamed of being a magical girl and striking those iconic poses? Now you can. Recreate them with your own arms in real life to invoke Cr\u00eape Magic and unleash powerful spells.\n\n**CRAFT TO BOOST YOUR SPELLS**\n{1646149939733127}\n\nAs the adventure intensifies, you\u2019ll need stronger magic. Go into a Crepo-Trance, grab the right ingredients, and cook cr\u00eapes at lightning speed to power up your abilities.\n\n**YOUR STORY: YOU ARE HANA, THE REINCARNATION OF THE CR\u00caPE GODDESS**\n\nIn the far reaches of space, a ruthless tyrant has sworn to destroy the cr\u00eape, the universal symbol of joy and community.\n\nOn Earth, a student named Hana discovers a ruby-studded pan. By seizing it, she awakens the powers of the legendary Cr\u00eape Goddess.\n\nIf the cr\u00eape disappears, the world will fall with it. It\u2019s time to fight back.\n", "short_description": "Cr\u00eape Master! is a fun, solo beat 'em up adventure in a colorful magical-girl style. Become the reincarnation of the Cr\u00eape Goddess and defend Earth against an alien invasion that threatens the world\u2019s most beloved treat."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://wip.hallucinations-studio.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Hallucinations Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://WWW.hallucinations-studio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "es"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "suppor